  "youtube": {
    "title": "Nobody Noticed (As Much As You Think) #shorts",
    "description": "You spill something, say something weird, trip in public, and it feels like the whole world saw.\n\nIt's called the spotlight effect. In a famous study, students wearing an embarrassing T-shirt guessed about half the room noticed. In reality, only about 1 in 4 did. Everyone else was busy worrying about themselves.\n\nResearch: Gilovich, Medvec & Savitsky (2000), Journal of Personality and Social Psychology.\n\n#shorts #psychology #socialanxiety #overthinking #confidence #animation #selfimprovement",
